modification, are permitted provided that the conditions stated in the
LICENSE file distributed with this project are met.

Author: Chengbo Du <cdu113@syr.edu>

Edit a Honeybee Model. Provides room- and surface-level overrides and
applies the HVAC, PV, SHW, DHW, and battery/wind IDF configurations
published by GDS Hub. Output is written to .hbjson.

INPUTS:
    _model         : Honeybee Model
    _run           : Trigger UI
    _gds_library   : Path to GDS module database JSON (optional)
    _output_path_  : Output .hbjson path (default: temp file)
    _preview_name_ : Brep parameter nickname for preview
                     (default "GDS envelope preview")
    _case_suffix_  : Suffix for model name and simulation folder
                     (default "designcase")

OUTPUTS:
    hbjson_path : Path to the saved .hbjson
    sim_folder  : Simulation folder path
    report      : Status messages
"""

